    "name": "FILEN-025: an unreachable backend and then revoked credentials are said at once, never 'up to date', and the edits wait and go up after",
    "description": "FILEN-025 (Filen): with the backend down during auth the CLI hung for days; behind a proxy nothing synced while the status said up to date. Rules E6 (sign in again, edits kept), O1 ('up to date' means nothing pending).",
    "steps": [
